The function is already minimal; I added `__builtin_expect` hints so the compiler lays out the common (valid profile/index) path as fall-through and keeps the two bounds checks out of the hot path.

```cpp
FIT_UINT16 Field::GetNumSubFields(void) const
{
    if (__builtin_expect(profile == NULL, 0))
        return 0;
    if (__builtin_expect(profileIndex >= profile->numFields, 0))
        return 0;
    return profile->fields[profileIndex].numSubFields;
}
```